    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_sister_02",
      "hash64": "0E4A0DC22ADDB010",
      "text": "This is the Crystal Pool. Bet you didn’t expect it\\nto be so pretty, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_sister_03",
      "hash64": "0E4A0EC22ADDB1C3",
      "text": "The crystals here are always shining. Isn’t that\\nstrange? There’s even a weird rumor that you\\r\\ncan meet people here who’ve passed away.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0300_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0E4A13C22ADDBA42",
      "text": "Now we’ll just need to get a little bit of the\\ncrystal from the bottom of the pool so we can\\r\\nfix the mask properly![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
